 out  of the picture  monica and her contacts might be useful  they could help to inform holden  about what's going on in the belt she  was able to get her hands on a video  feed of cordazar being kidnapped and she  may turn out to be really useful in this  storyline  after all she did get the flight path of  the zamaya and so now they will be  trying to chase down the stolen  proto-molecule sample  moving on to alex and bobby they were  able to get out of their last scrape  with the free navy  and they are back up and running but the  razorback isn't a gunship so they can't  really do much  other than flee the free navy it's not  like they can engage with them  also enough time has probably passed at  this point that they have no chance of  catching back up with the bar keith  soviter and babbage are probably gone  for all intents and purposes  they seem to make their pass off to the  free navy with those ships  we heard drummer's crew say that it was  a light  cruiser which is the pella and two heavy  frigates which is what they were  traveling with  as their escorts those are the ships  that they dropped off it seems like that  part of their mission is now complete as  marco has those ships  unlike the other members of the rossi  crew alex is able to contact holden as  far as we could tell so it's possible  that they might enter into that hunt for  the zamaya beyond that we're just not  sure at this point  so i'd be interested to hear what you  guys think these two are going to get  into  in the comments one of the biggest  developments in  episode 6 was drummer and her family  making the tough decision to join up  with the free navy  drummer sees the writing on the wall as  she's on the pella  and she's getting ready to meet with  marco she says that he's consolidating  support amongst the factions of the belt  and oxana says  if he has black sky and golden bow with  him then half the opa will rally to his  banner i think the conversation she had  with marco did a great job of setting up  a very tenuous  partnership that we have to imagine  might fail down the road we know she has  no respect for marco on a personal level  because of the deaths of ashford and  fred she made this  plane her crewmates know this and from  the conversation we could see that marco  knows this as well  at the same time her and her family  believe that joining  sides with him and these other factions  of the opa  is the best way for them to ensure their  own survival  they've traded crewmates with marcos  sending karol  onto drummer's ship and i think at the  very least this is an indication that he  knows he can't  exactly trust drummer so he wants one of  his best people to be there to watch her  there could be more to that but we'll  have to wait and see  as far as what comes next with drummer  and her part of the story when she saw  phillip she figured out that naomi was  on the ship based off of what he said  that may play a part in how she feels  about this arrangement but it doesn't  really change the reality of the  situation they can't get into a fight  with marco  he way outpowers everyone in the belt so  it's very possible  that we won't see all that much more  happen with this in this  season you know there was a big  conversation online going on about how  people thought that the last episode was  a filler episode  i would disagree with that on the basis  of the definition of a filler episode  and then also disagree with anybody who  said nothing happened in that episode  but all of that aside the reality of  these two books book five and six is  that they are a duology  book five introduces the free navy the  dynamics in the system  change we see what the stakes are the  characters move around  and they grow and it all works to make  it matter  when we get to the conclusion of this  part of the series  it's definitely going somewhere you can  trust me on that but i'm not sure that  we'll get resolutions to all the  different story lines  before the end of season six one place  where i do expect some movement  soon if not the next episode then in the  next two episodes at the very least  is with naomi's story and her being a  captive on the pella  just like episode six was heavy on the  amos story  i think we have one of those coming up  for naomi really soon  in the last episode we saw that philip  was kind of warming up to her  and we can imagine that's something that  marco won't be happy about  and that'll be on top of the fact that  sin has already kind of stuck his neck  out for her  and got in marco's face in front of the  entire crew  i mentioned in my breakdown that i was a  little unsure of the way they're  depicting marco  and then i had a lot of people asking  for details in the comments  what it boils down to is that we're  missing naomi telling us  who marco is in her eyes and i open with  an excerpt from one of her chapters so  you can get an idea of how that works  what the characters doing on the show  might be a hundred percent in line with  what he did in the books but it feels  different to me without that framing and  i trust the writers  they've earned that i'm just saying that  as a fan who has  expectations tv show marco has made some  decisions that don't make sense to me at  this point and i say that all knowing  very well that  it all might make sense in a couple of  episodes another thing that some people  mention in the comments is that  marco is actually doing a lot of stuff  but we don't actually see what any of it  is  at the end of the episode we see him  watching naomi and philip together and  then we see him pull up this display of  his fleet where he's thinking about  using the chet's mocha which she arrived  on to intercept the rasanante on his way  to the zamaya  so most of what we see marco doing is  talking to the other characters but  there's a whole lot of other stuff going  on that hasn't yet been revealed  based on him looking at the rossi  chasing after the zamaya  i think we could say that he is going to  be planning on doing something with that  in the next episode  and obviously naomi will be trying to do  her best to  undermine anything he's doing and trying  to get herself out of this situation  and back to her crew on the rossi the  name of the episode  is the belter word for goodbye and i saw  the idea out there that we might see  this flashback scene from the trailer  where phillips a child in the happy  times of marco and naomi's relationship  considering that she had to say goodbye  to that family because of the way that  things were there's definitely a  possibility of that  and there's also the possibility that  she has to say goodbye again  so that's something to think about so i  think that covers where everybody's at  and that seems like a good place to  leave it let me know in the comments  what you think's gonna happen  your theories your predictions what  you're hoping to see  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon


